WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.450
"Bar"
"Noma Noma"

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:20.450
Organ, do you think it's really true
that a Dragonkin showed up in Yahoo?

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:26.200
"No" is what I'd like to say,
but there are never any guarantees in this world.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.290
It sounds like such a fairy tale, doesn't it?

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:30.160
A Dragonkin taking a stand against evil...

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.000
"Chunibyo" "S-Rank Adventurer" "Mink"
A Dragonkin taking a stand against evil...

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.830
"Devilkin S-Rank Adventurer" "Organ"
If there really was one,

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:37.330
"Devilkin S-Rank Adventurer" "Organ"
the Beast Kingdom would be all over it, though.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:40.910
Maybe he's a wild Dragonkin or something?

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:42.750
Don't be absurd.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.580
The union of Human and Dragon is celebrated,

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:49.830
yet the offspring of Human and
Demon is detested and prosecuted.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.540
What an illogical and ridiculous world.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:57.040
"Noma Noma Bar Owner" "Iei"
The Dragonkin is great and all, Mink...

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.950
But I recommend this one.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:06.500
This man is apparently
calling himself Demon Lord.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.870
If you hang around him, you never
know what sort of fun you'll get into.

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:12.950
Oho?

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:19.620
I feel the waves of destiny gushing within me!

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:23.500
My right eye is throbbing!
I see it! I see it all!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:28.160
By the hands of that man,
the future of our world will plunge into chaos!

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:31.750
Organ, let's perform a blood oath right here.

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:35.000
The coming chaos is darker
than the deepest shadow!

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.500
You're a Priest, you know.
What are you talking about?

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.410
"Mikan"
If I'm not mistaken,

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:46.830
"Mikan"
isn't that the S-Rank adventurers, Mink and Organ?

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.370
Demon Lord may be out of our league,

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:50.540
but they might be able to handle him.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.830
"Yukikaze"
but they might be able to handle him.

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.750
"Yukikaze"
The old man is mine and mine only.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.660
No one else lays hands on him! No one!

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:06.830
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:13.370
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:16.950
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:20.250
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.660
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:32.450
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:39.000
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:45.830
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:53.080
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.370
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:01.830
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:05.250
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.700
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:12.000
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.660
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.830
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:22.410
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.040
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.040
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:33.950
"Turmoil in the Capital"

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:37.450
"Upscale Bar"
"Artemis"

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:50.000
This place is quite impressive.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.580
Right? This is one of my
favorite places to come to.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.250
Welcome, Miss Luna. Thank you for coming again.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.660
It's always a pleasure to have you.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.290
Thank you.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:06.500
But today we came to celebrate
a special occasion for one of my friends.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.370
Please keep that in mind.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:11.700
Understood.

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:18.200
"Yu Kirino"
Let us start with a toast and raise our glasses

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.700
"Yu Kirino"
to Aku's leg being healed.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.950
Cheers!

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.290
Aku, congratulations.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.620
Congratulations, Aku.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.910
Th-Thank you very much.

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.330
You're the star for today.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:38.120
Forget about manners
and eat as much as you'd like.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.160
Okay!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.870
I guess we should stick
to more casual places to eat.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:05.370
If this is a celebration,
it's about time I make it seem like one...

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.290
Excuse me. Could you do me a favor?

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.330
Certainly. Anything.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.540
I'd like someone to bring this over to my table.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.080
Wh-Whoa!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.910
Item Construct!

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.120
Aku, this is a present from me.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.080
"Strawberry Tart"

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.700
Wow! Demon Lord, is this candy?!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.620
It looks so incredibly cute!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.910
Yu, slice this up for us.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:48.540
Sure thing, Chief.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:01.540
It's sweet, delicious, and cute!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:05.200
Ah, so yummy! It melts in my mouth!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:09.620
This must be what happiness tastes like, Chief.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:16.120
You look like you're having
a grand old time, Luna.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.120
Hmm? Madam?

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:26.160
What's the deal with this super-rich lady?!

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:28.750
Her whole body is sparkling!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:33.250
I'm sorry for interrupting when
you're all enjoying yourselves so much.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.330
Greetings, Madam. I'm afraid I don't know you.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.410
My name is Hakuto Kunai.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:42.830
"Big Shot of High Society" "Shrimpfry Butterfly"
Dear me, I haven't introduced myself yet.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:45.450
I'm Shrimpfry Butterfly.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.450
Is she some one gag comedian?!

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:51.160
Madam, would you care to sit down and join us?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.450
H-Hey now, Demon Lord!

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:59.410
Oh, my. For the rumored Demon Lord
to personally invite me. How exciting!

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:04.370
She knows about me and yet still came to talk?

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:06.200
Must be one shrewd woman.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:09.000
"Message"
Luna, who is this Madam?

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:13.700
Huh?! Now I'm hearing
his repulsive voice in my head...

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:17.120
That "repulsive" was cruel, but just answer me.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.540
What's the matter, Luna?

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:22.620
Um, nothing at all! Nothing at all...

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:27.330
You can't tell it's a skill of mine
to talk in secret without being heard?

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:30.080
You don't think I knew that? Sheesh!

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:33.950
Madam is the center figure
for all the wives of nobility.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:38.250
She has tons of connections
and is hugely influential among nobles.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.700
I see... Then she's like
the queen of high society?

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:45.250
Yeah, right. She'd be dangerous
to have as an enemy.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.250
I've got a good idea.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:52.950
If I somehow gain her trust,
that means she'll become an unbeatable ally.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:02.700
Madam, we've come here tonight
to congratulate Aku on her injury healing.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:06.160
If you wouldn't mind,
perhaps you could say something too?

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:10.660
Oh, my, is that so? Congratulations, Aku.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:13.370
Th-Thank you very much.

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:16.870
By the way, is this your
first time in the city, Aku?

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:19.500
Y-Yes, that's right.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:23.450
Everything I see here
is so pretty, I can't believe it!

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:27.700
Really? You're such a cute and honest little one.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.330
I-I'm not...

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:33.200
Yeah, isn't she?
I'm proud to have her as a friend!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.370
Y-You're too much...

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:38.700
And what do you think of the city,
Mr. Demon Lord?

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:41.200
It's truly spectacular.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.540
It's very authentic and easy to admire.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:47.870
Compared to the impoverished
lands I passed by during my travels,

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:51.580
the Holy Capital's prosperity
is an astonishment to behold.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:54.910
You're absolutely correct.

00:08:54.910 --> 00:09:01.370
It's not unusual to compare the lands
of the kingdom to Heaven and Hell.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:04.450
That couldn't be any closer to the truth.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:08.950
However, I do know a method
in which that problem could be solved.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:16.540
I would love to hear your wisdom
on the matter, Mr. Demon Lord.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.950
It's rather simple, actually.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.330
By transforming every last land into Heaven,

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:28.620
there will simply be no more problems.
It's that easy.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:32.750
Th-This seems like a rather
large-scale proposition of yours.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:38.160
If I sat at the top of the kingdom,
it could be done in a few mere years.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.330
My...

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.540
But instead of these boring
problems of the country,

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:48.040
I have a different "Heaven"
I'd like to introduce you to.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.500
That sounds very intriguing.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.700
And what is this "Heaven" of yours?

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.160
It's this right here.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.040
Soap?

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:03.540
Oh! That soap is the best thing ever!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:07.910
It washes away dirt like magic
and leaves your skin sparkling!

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:12.040
Magic... Sparkling, huh?

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.370
Nice assist, Luna!

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:24.910
Indeed, the skin of all these
ladies here sure is dazzling...

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.000
I urge you to give it a try tonight.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.540
I think you'll be astonished
at how well it works.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:36.580
I may just. Thank you for
the wonderful gift, Demon Lord.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:41.000
Oh, please. There's no need
to thank me over such a trivial thing.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:45.910
But I am planning to open a hot spring
in the village of Rabby sometime soon.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:50.120
It's a place where your skin--
your entirety will be revived!

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:55.040
Revived, you say?
Now those are some bold claims you make.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:11:00.700
When it comes to ideas which I devise,
none are lies or falsehood.

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:05.620
Because every word that comes
out of my mouth, I make true.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:08.500
It won't be just an ordinary bath, you see.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.000
Carbon dioxide baths, vase baths, stone saunas,

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.750
electric baths, herbal baths, salt saunas...

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:17.330
...and so much more for guests to enjoy.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:21.500
Not only will it help exhaustion,
stiff muscles, and cold sensitivity...

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:24.660
Your skin will feel years
younger when you're done!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:28.950
P-Please! Please let me come and visit!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.700
Luna, keep this a secret
from my little sister, Oysterfry.

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:37.370
Oh, Madam. You must not be getting
along with your sister as usual.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.830
I'm in the same boat as you.

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:43.540
Sisters just have a hard time seeing eye to eye.

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:47.330
There's an Oysterfry too?!
Get along with your fry family!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.830
I-It's a Satanist attack!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:05.950
--Satanists?
--What are they doing here?!
--I'm scared...

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:11.660
We've finally got a sideshow of clowns
to spice up this dinner banquet.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.160
I see, it's a synchronized attack...

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.000
I guess they're not half bad.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.830
Yu, stay here and protect all these people.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.290
I'll go snuff out all the turmoil.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.500
Understood, Chief.

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.290
H-Hold up! Don't decide that on your own!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.160
I'm going with you!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:52.870
Luna, it's quite possible that
you're the target of this attack.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:56.950
There's no hope for me to protect you
if you're walking around the streets.

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:58.870
P-Protect me?!

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:02.330
I-It's not like I need you to protect me...

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.620
Will she be okay being this easy to read?

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:08.870
Aku, there's nothing to
worry about if you're with Yu.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.750
Just try to enjoy the rest of your meal.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.910
O-Okay.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.290
B-But...

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.750
Will you be all right, Demon Lord?

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:23.200
She's like a daughter
worried about her father...

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:27.750
It's a sideshow. I'm just burning
off some calories after dinner.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.700
You should return to your meal too, Madam.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:35.200
I must say, you sure are a confident one...

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.370
Though, if I put it in your own words...

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:41.950
Is it because everything you say comes true?

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.160
That's exactly right.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:49.080
It's unfortunate for these guys
that I happened to be here today.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.290
"Message"

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:56.500
Yu... If we're to learn anything,
we need to be able to move easily.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.910
So we avoid crude behavior
and improve our reputation?

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:02.790
It's great that you always catch on so quickly.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:07.040
I'm counting on you, Yu.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.540
O-Oday!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.660
Hmm? Did she just stutter or something?

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.580
No way, it's Yu we're talking about...

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.950
Now then, I wonder where I should start?

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:36.200
They keep popping up no matter where I go...

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:39.950
If you want to meet a Demon Lord
so badly, I'll grant your wish.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.120
Take this!

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:46.160
"Heavy Strike"

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.040
You asked for it!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.450
"Whirlwind"

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:54.370
You damn, rotten adventurers!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.120
"Ice Blade" "Ice Slash"
Ice Slash!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.790
Thou shall become a frozen cold Mikan.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:02.370
"Sweetheart of Snow" "Snow Kiss"
Snow Kiss!

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.370
Thanks for the save, Yukikaze.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:08.500
V for Victory. Sweetheart of your mouth.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:11.450
Grab them by the ocean's edge.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.290
Ice Hand!

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.700
"Hand of Ice"
"Ice Hand"

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:22.160
It's about time that we
broke the ice. Ice Splash!

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.040
Don't falter! We outnumber them!

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:31.410
Keep up the attack for as long as we can!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:38.120
This isn't looking good. What now, Yukikaze?

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:41.330
Dying a virgin was never part of my plan.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.330
Impressive how unfazed you are
at a time like this.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.700
And anyways, you're a guy, so--

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.830
That's a clown for you.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:59.620
Would anyone else like to put on a good show?

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.160
Old man!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.040
We meet again! He's so dreamy!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.040
Demon Lord!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:10.450
Demon Lord, is it? You dare stand in our way?!

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:15.580
Who do you think you're dealing with?

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.120
Kneel before me!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.410
"Champion"
Champion!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.160
What I do to trash like you...

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.200
"Enlightenment"
Enlightenment!

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.410
...is show you where you belong.

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:33.750
Pulverize!

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:37.450
"Pulverize"

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:46.330
The truth of the matter is,
I'm completely justified to be angry at you.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.370
Though I'm a little grateful too.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:52.750
I-I'm not gonna die like this!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:59.290
May disaster befall... this cursed land!

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.620
Summon Devil!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.250
"Mid-Level Demon" "Carnival"
Huh?

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:20.950
I got called here by a bunch
of puny humans? What gives?

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:24.250
Hey, Yukikaze. That's a Demon, right?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:28.000
Yeah. The Satanists summoned
it in exchange for their lives.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.830
It's not looking good.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.870
Whatever. Looks like there's
a lot of tasty snacks to eat here.

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:41.330
Oh, boy! It's time to set the table
and let despair fill the air!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.500
"Imprisonment Area" "Killing Field"
Killing Field!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.540
It sounds like the turmoil is getting worse.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:59.700
And I'm getting chills out of nowhere...

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.160
I think that was Barrier Magic.

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:03.620
Meaning?

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:07.540
This whole area has been trapped and closed off.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:11.410
We won't be able to escape unless he's defeated.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:17.620
Yeah, that's right!
It's time, my little kittens!

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:20.750
Come play with Mr. Carnival of Hell!

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:26.160
Sing along with the sound of my music
with your wails, cries, and screams of--

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:38.160
Wh-Who's the damn vermin who did that to me?!

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:42.200
That filthy mouth suits you much better.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:45.950
Was it you?! You shitty dirtbag!

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:50.330
What a disgrace.
You're a swine with an ugly face.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:53.830
Your voice is putrid and your clothes hideous.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:59.290
You seem as worthless as it gets,
but maybe you're good for a laugh at best.

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:02.700
I'll kill you!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:12.250
I must admit, this is the second time
I've run into a Demon.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:16.250
"Survival Skill 'Fighting Spirit' activated"
"+10% to user's Offense and Defense"
The last one unfortunately died all too fast.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.450
"Combat Skill 'Strength Drain' activated"
"10% to target's Offense"
The last one unfortunately died all too fast.

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:20.540
How do you think you'll fare?

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.200
"Combat Skill 'Overpower' activated"
"-10% to target's Defense"
For academic purposes,

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.660
"Combat Skill 'Overpower' activated"
"-10% to target's Defense"
I've decided to go all out this time.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:29.580
"Combat Skill 'Peerless' activated"
"+30% to user's Offense and Defense"

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:35.910
You called yourself Carnival, huh?
Are you ready for this?

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:39.700
W-Wait, you wonderful monsieur!
I was wrong! I was--

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:42.790
Oops, I forgot something important...

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:46.660
Wh-Whatever that important thing is,
I'll help you with it!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.790
I'll do whatever you like!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.120
"Status change: 'Battle Ready'
"Stance change: 'Retaliation Stance'"

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:57.750
N-No! I don't wanna be killed
by a human in a place like this!

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:02.080
I'm sure you've done plenty of killing till now.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.910
You should at least feel
what it's like to die for once.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.330
What filthy fireworks.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:40.120
This is you, right? Long live Demon Lord!

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:42.290
Demon Lord, you're something else!

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.830
Mister, let me buy you a drink!

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:49.040
Well, when you're as good as me,
that much is nothing.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.120
Old man!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:56.160
You've saved me two times now,
and I want to pay you back!

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:01.830
There's no need for that.
This was something important for me too.

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:04.660
Could you please tell me your name, old man?

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:08.330
"Old"... The me in here is still young.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:10.790
I'm Hakuto Kunai.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.410
Hakuto... Kunai...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.120
The old man and I are bound
by the red string of fate!

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:25.000
H-Hold up, Yukikaze!
I'm sure you're being fooled somehow!

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:26.370
Jealous, Mikan?

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:28.330
Why the hell would I be jealous?!

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:30.540
If you must know where my heart lies,

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.330
--I prefer heroes like that Dragonkin who love justice!

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.660
--Hmm? That Dragonkin, huh?
--I prefer heroes like that Dragonkin who love justice!

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.120
--Hmm? That Dragonkin, huh?
--How naughty.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.160
"Justice = Just Ass"
--You prefer people who love just ass.

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:39.660
--Um, I think you said it wrong.
--You prefer people who love just ass.

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:41.660
--Um, I think you said it wrong.
--That's not even close to the same word!

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:45.540
--It's not even close?
--Argh, Yukikaze! I can't take it!

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:46.790
What the hell?!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:21.290
For battle within the Game,
you put together your skills

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:25.660
and combo them all together
to however you best see fit.

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:29.950
Depending on how you combo,
it's possible to do astronomical damage.

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:33.790
If you're an expert at it, it's said you
can do enough damage to kill a god.

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:38.120
What filthy fireworks.

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:40.080
You put on a show, Demon Lord!

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:42.250
Wh-Who told you that?

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:46.500
"All or Nothing"
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry </i>Episode 7.
All or Nothing.
